> Dear Markos,

> I trust this email finds you very well. Thank you for the update on the delivery of the shipment to the end users. It is an honour for my Embassy to facilitate the transfer of the items.

> I would also like to thank everyone involved in making this happen.

> This donation could not have happened without the help of Mr. Jerry Zdril, President of RWH. He and his team have become a pillar of Ethiopia. I greatly admire and respect his commitment to helping the less fortunate, and for helping my wife and me during our mission on many different occasions. A huge thank you for his continuous commitment!

> Regards,  
Tewodros
